-- ============================================================
-- Improved Thunder Clap -- Warrior Protection talent redesign
-- ============================================================
-- RECONSTRUCTED 2026-08-10.  The original file was overwritten and its
-- prose is lost.  The rows below were re-emitted verbatim from the live
-- alonecraft_spell_dbc, so the data is exact; only the commentary is new,
-- rebuilt from the header of WarriorImprovedThunderClap.cpp.
--
-- Ranks 12287 / 12665 / 12666.  Thunder Clap gains radius 8 -> 10/12/15
-- yards and +33/66/100% damage, and bleeds every target it hits for
-- 33/66/100% of block value over 6 sec.
--
-- Handled by DBC (these rows):
--   Effect 1  ADD_FLAT_MODIFIER (107) / SPELLMOD_RADIUS  (MiscValue 6)
--   Effect 2  ADD_PCT_MODIFIER  (108) / SPELLMOD_DAMAGE
--   Effect 3  a bare SPELL_AURA_DUMMY (4) that exists only to carry the
--             per-rank bleed percentage for the script to read.
--   Both modifiers are masked to Thunder Clap's family flag so they cannot
--   leak onto other Warrior abilities.
--
-- Handled in C++ (WarriorImprovedThunderClap.cpp):
--   The bleed.  Block value is neither a stat nor a rating --
--   Player::GetShieldBlockValue derives it from Strength and the
--   SHIELD_BLOCK_VALUE base mods -- so no aura can read it as a damage
--   source.
--
-- 200661 Thunderstruck is the bleed payload.  SpellFamilyName 0 so it picks
-- up neither Warrior spell modifiers nor any Warrior proc filter, and
-- ALWAYS_HIT / IGNORE_DAMAGE_TAKEN_MODIFIERS / CANT_CRIT so its ticks do not
-- re-roll a hit check, crit twice, or get scaled twice.
--
-- Registered on -6343, i.e. every rank of Thunder Clap.
-- ============================================================

